+<section class="wrap section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p>A few things people often ask.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I change plans at any time?</summary><div class="answer">Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your team’s needs change. Upgrades take effect right away, and we’ll prorate the difference.</div></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><div class="answer">Choose yearly billing and pay once for the year at an effective rate 20% lower than monthly billing. The displayed price is per user, per month; yearly plans are billed annually.</div></details><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><div class="answer">Yes. The Free plan is free to use with up to 10 members, and you can explore Relay before deciding whether a paid plan is right for you.</div></details><details><summary>What happens to my data if I cancel?</summary><div class="answer">Your workspace remains accessible through the end of your billing period. You can export your messages and files before then, and we never sell your team’s data.</div></details><details><summary>Do you offer plans for larger organizations?</summary><div class="answer">Business is built for growing teams. For custom security, provisioning, or organization-wide requirements, contact our team and we’ll help find the right fit.</div></details></div></section>
